0..75 Comment "//! A fold over each index of a family that gives two answers for one term."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..155 Comment "//! A rule of a family makes its two sides one term. A fold over the family"
156..236 Comment "//! reads a term by its constructors, so an arm can give the two sides of a rule"
237..253 Comment "//! two answers."
254..257 Comment "//!"
258..335 Comment "//! The checker stands the fold at the index of the root of each rule, and it"
336..413 Comment "//! compares the fold on the two sides. It refuses the fold by the first rule"
414..446 Comment "//! whose sides get two answers."
447..450 Comment "//!"
451..467 Comment "//! - see: #8365"
468..546 Comment "//! - see: `model/desc/fold-over-family.gandr` — the folds that respect each"
547..557 Comment "//!   rule"
559..581 Comment "// `Width` and `Gate`."
